# Device XNU patch series (one patch path per line, applied in order, # starts a comment).
#
# 0002: BCM2837.h hardcodes PLATFORM_PANIC_LOG_PADDR = 0x3c0fc000, a Raspberry Pi
# address that does not exist on NX741J. check_for_panic_log() maps it and reads
# a magic word, which takes an external abort inside PE_create_console() before the
# console exists. With the macro undefined the device tree path is used and returns
# immediately (our ADT has no pram node).
#
# 0003: skip KLDBootstrap::loadSecurityExtensions(). AppleImage4 is in the security
# extension list, its start() fails with "failed to get crypto algorithm: 2" and
# panics, which blocks the boot before the root volume. AMFI's early_security_init
# is not wired in this port yet, so the pass has nothing to do anyway.
0002-bcm2837-drop-panic-log-paddr.patch
0003-skip-security-extensions.patch
